## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to architect an edge, low-latency policy enforcement layer with per-tenant privacy controls, hot policy updates, and drift detection in a multi-tenant LLM-ops gateway. Emphasizes data locality, auditability, and resilience.

## Key Concepts

- Edge policy engine with per-tenant versioning
- Privacy controls: PII redaction, data minimization
- Hot-updatable policies and drift alerts
- Latency budgets and data locality guarantees
- Immutable audit logs

## Code Example

